elements.text:
When
                @head.auth matches 'smufl', @head.shape must contain a numeric glyph reference in
                hexadecimal notation, like "#xE000" or "U+E000".

spacing.staff.description:
Specifies the minimum amount of space between adjacent staves in the same system;
          measured from the bottom line of the staff above to the top line of the staff
          below.

